      "title": "Dupa \"+ Adaugă\", butonul de adaugare ajunge grefat/nested GRESIT in interiorul noului <li>, nu ca frate dupa <ul>",
      "detail": "outerHTML noul <li>: <li class=\"pr-svc__card\">\n                        <h3 class=\"pr-svc__title hb-list-item\"><span data-hb-edit=\"services.4.label\" data-hb-kind=\"text\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"hb-remove-btn\" aria-label=\"Șterge elementul 5\">×</button></h3><button type=\"button\" class=\"hb-add-btn\">+ Adaugă</button>\n                        \n                    < — structura DOM se degradeaza progresiv la adaugari repetate.",
      "screenshot": "13-service-item-added.png",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-05T21:32:12.274Z"
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Lipseste JSON-LD structured data (LocalBusiness) pe pagina live",
      "detail": "template.html are bloc <!-- @if seo.jsonLd --> dar seo.jsonLd e gol la publish prin builder-ul web (bot/flow.js buildSeo() populeaza jsonLd doar in fluxul Telegram, build.js/normalizeConfigForRender nu calculeaza seo.jsonLd deloc — doar seo.ogImage via deriveSocialImage). Deja notat ca gol cunoscut in VISION.md §4.6 (\"SEO insuficient expus\").",
      "screenshot": "17-live-site-desktop.png",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-05T21:33:06.867Z"
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Lipsesc complet <link rel=canonical> si <meta property=og:url> pe orice site publicat",
      "detail": "seo.canonical apare doar ca token in build.js linia ~109 dar nu e populat NICAIERI in cod (grep confirmat) — blocul <!-- @if seo.canonical --> e mereu fals, deci ambele tag-uri lipsesc din <head> pe toate site-urile publicate prin builder-ul web, nu doar professionals.",
      "screenshot": "17-live-site-desktop.png",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-05T21:33:06.868Z"
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "og:image / twitter:image sunt cai RELATIVE, nu absolute (incalca spec Open Graph)",
      "detail": "continut meta: \"images/hero.jpg\" — Open Graph/Twitter Card cer URL absolut; Facebook/WhatsApp/LinkedIn/iMessage de regula NU rezolva un og:image relativ, deci preview-ul de share ar putea sa nu arate poza. Cauza: build.js deriveSocialImage() intoarce orice string brut gasit in config care se potriveste /image|photo|logo|src/i, fara sa-l rezolve fata de PUBLIC_URL.",
      "screenshot": "17-live-site-desktop.png",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-05T21:33:06.869Z"
    },
